lass=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890510/extras/43dbf5573bf61ad1b4bd873e32528bbb.poster.avif?t=1750165582\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890510/extras/43dbf5573bf61ad1b4bd873e32528bbb.webm?t=1750165582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890510/extras/43dbf5573bf61ad1b4bd873e32528bbb.mp4?t=1750165582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>So if you're ready to take on the ultimate shooter challenge, download Final Shot today and get ready to unleash your inner warrior. It's time to show the world what you're made of \u2014 are you ready for the final shot?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890510/extras/1778cf2e289f1b863afa73a3ce0c8751.poster.avif?t=1750165582\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890510/extras/1778cf2e289f1b863afa73a3ce0c8751.webm?t=1750165582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890510/extras/1778cf2e289f1b863afa73a3ce0c8751.mp4?t=1750165582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
